 "sample": "GREMIO:\nGood morrow, neighbour.\n\nGREMIO:\nA hare, sir, by lady, thoughts are content.\n\nHORTENSIO:\nWhy, Biondello; lad me indeed you, sir, as you\ndear to be imprise with, I'll af have men as you.\n\nGRUMIO:\nSarry, ran she's the wall right; you will tell you, hoar.\n\nGREMIO:\nWhy, this princes! I pray you, shave you, look you! Signior Tranio?\n\nTRANIO:\nHast'd you? But the coious senchio?\n\nPETRXIO:\nMaster court's man",
